WEBVTT

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.870
An Ogham Wheel?

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:48.370
Why is this here?

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.960
Twelve and twelve...

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.590
Two Covens encircle me...

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.360
I feel like it'll disappear...

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:42.090
...the instant I look away.

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:47.230
I just kept counting...

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:52.670
...all the many traces of loneliness...

00:01:52.630 --> 00:02:00.040
...that I'd vomited up.

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:05.980
In this time that seems so dry,

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:11.090
...my heart is thrashing around and drowning.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:16.950
It takes those lies that make my head spin...

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:20.000
...and tears them to pieces.

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:29.670
 And the place I lose my way in...

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:37.500
...is a dim, hazy world.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:03:00.040
A thousand powers lost a thousand years ago.

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:03.910
Yet even now the descendants of the fallen gods inherit them.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:08.110
They carry in their blood a power that was sealed away...

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:11.350
...into the darkness far back in the mists of time.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:14.720
A power sealed away into the darkness...?

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.230
A Craft...

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:24.290
The ancient power that governs this body...

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.730
I...

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.340
Amon?

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:57.630
Robin.

00:03:59.570 --> 00:04:01.230
What's wrong? Come in.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:02.640
Robin.

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:03.870
Oh. I read you.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:05.470
What were you doing?

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:07.780
Sorry.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:10.510
The Witch turned at container #3 and headed your way.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:13.570
We'll catch him in a pincer movement. Get ahead of him on his left.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.110
Got it.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:24.990
Over here?

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.680
This ought to be the right spot...

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.020
An Ogam Circle?

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.540
Where are they? Where are they shooting from?

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:34.020
This is it...

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:36.890
The Runes of Andred...

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:38.490
Robin, what's wrong?

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.970
The Witch should be heading your way.

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.700
Report your status, Robin.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:45.140
Robin!

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:04.360
I've taken care of things with the Factory for now.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:09.030
Are we clear on this? Don't ever screw up like that again.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:10.170
But...

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:11.430
Save the excuses.

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:13.070
I'm not lying.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.460
I didn't hear any gunfire.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.270
But that's not...

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.500
Go home for today.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:46.330
I thought he'd be here.

00:06:48.100 --> 00:06:49.130
A cartridge case?

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:51.940
You can investigate those, can't you?

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:53.100
Investigate what?

00:06:53.410 --> 00:06:57.380
Like what kind of gun it's used in, and where they're used right now.

00:06:57.380 --> 00:07:01.780
Sure, I guess I can do that. But why the big rush?

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:05.010
Just curious. But do you think you could do it right away?

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:06.850
Oh, so you're in a hurry...

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:12.030
All right, I'll see what I can do.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.490
You're a big help.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:15.720
Oh, and...

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:19.270
Could you keep this from Amon?

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:22.200
Sure, I guess, but...

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:23.690
I'll leave you to it, then.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.670
What will it be? Dinner or a bath?

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.420
No contest.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:21.090
Save the excuses.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:25.770
But I wasn't lying...

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:04.130
An anti-Witch bullet...

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:14.480
What's Robin doing with this?

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:32.170
Five years ago?

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.500
Five years and three months ago, to be exact.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:37.200
That's when their use was banned.

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:39.370
So why ask me?

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:42.080
The info is buried really deep, so I can't find out much about it.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:45.410
Other than Mr. Amon, you're the only one who was around in the old days five years ago.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:49.350
What do you mean, old days? I'm not exactly an old maid yet!

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:51.690
Anyone older than me is an old maid, anyway.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.190
Watch it, sonny.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:55.120
Huh? Who's an old maid?

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:57.490
Good work. Did you have any luck?

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.260
None at all...

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:02.760
I couldn't find hide or hair of anyone like you mentioned.

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:03.790
It's like he's a ghost or something.

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:06.660
Maybe this Witch was a hoax after all.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:08.230
But what Amon was...

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:14.360
Speaking of which, what's this about you and Amon way back when, Miho?

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.710
Oh, you mean THIS?

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:18.440
Miss Karasuma...

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:21.140
Try scrying that.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:29.720
Anything?

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.060
Give me a minute.

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:38.020
No psychic residue.

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.000
Right?

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:43.870
I mention this earlier, but this casing is from a bullet...

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:47.070
...that the STN-J used to use against Witches.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:51.110
See? It's got these weird letters engraved here.

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:53.580
I think they're some sort of charm against evil spirits.

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.640
Where did you get something like that?

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:58.350
Wait... From Robin?

00:10:59.850 --> 00:11:00.960
Does Amon know?

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.920
Apparently, she wants this kept secret from Amon.

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:08.260
This was fired recently.

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:12.390
Hey, what was Robin doing with the casing of an anti-Witch bullet?

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:18.170
Where are she and Amon on stakeout right now?

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.070
The same location as yesterday.

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:21.880
Sakaki, come with me.

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:23.340
What's this all about?

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:24.400
This worries me.

00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:26.380
An anti-Witch bullet...

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:29.310
And a Witch that's as elusive as a shadow.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.150
A trap?

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:33.210
Perhaps.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:39.430
Let us know if you hear anything from Amon.

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:40.290
Okay.

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:01.140
I see. Take care of it.

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:47.820
Maybe this really is just a hoax.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:50.900
I don't see any cars that fit the description.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:53.500
We'll go around the block again.

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:22.560
Touko let the mail pile up again...

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:35.200
For me?

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:38.710
I wonder what it is...

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:51.060
What now?

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:52.750
Go back?

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:55.530
Let's try Robin's place.

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:57.500
What's the deal? You're obsessing over this.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.300
Something about this bothers me.

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:05.330
Come to think of it, Amon didn't even mention last night's failure at the briefing today.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.470
He's never acted this way before...

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:10.510
Let's go.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.350
Touko's back.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:29.330
Huh?

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.140
Touko!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:17.780
Miss Karasuma!

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:27.580
Why are you...

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:36.600
The Ward of Lagu!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:47.540
The ward, it's...!

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:04.650
Touko...

00:16:07.260 --> 00:16:07.890
Tou...

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:09.730
Touko!

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:46.000
Robin! Are you all right?!

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:47.360
What's going on?!

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.170
The circle's been destroyed...!

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.110
Miss Karasuma, watch the room!

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:08.480
Damn!

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:14.150
Robin!

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.290
Chasing them won't do any good!

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:18.160
Karasuma! Take care of Touko!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:19.600
What about you?!

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:20.590
I'm fine.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:31.970
Those are...

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:40.280
I'm sorry.

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:42.280
Stay where you are.

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:45.250
Amon...?

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:03.440
What do we do now?

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:05.440
She can't come back here.

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:08.640
Robin can sleep over at the office.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:12.140
The office? Yes, you're right.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:19.630
Amon, we're thinking of going to the hospital.

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:21.090
What about you?

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.550
Good idea.

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:26.570
On second thought, I'd better not.

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:29.660
It's all right. I kept the police out of it.

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:33.460
A crime scene team will go in, but it will only be for show.

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.700
I won't let them touch the scene.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:39.310
The real question is, how did this happen?

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:42.670
What?!

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:47.920
The reason why Robin was attacked?

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:51.370
When you stop and think about it, isn't the timing a little too perfect?

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:52.680
With what?

00:19:52.950 --> 00:19:54.590
The Inquisitor.

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:59.290
But that Inquisitor wasn't here to question Robin or anything...

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:01.120
That may be the official story,

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:05.360
...but it's not like we were aware of every move that Inquisitor made, right?

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:06.620
Besides...

00:20:08.300 --> 00:20:10.270
...it feels almost the same.

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:12.670
Like it did back then.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.740
Like when Kate was killed.

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:18.650
Kate...

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:25.150
It had totally slipped my mind ever since Robin came, but it's only been eight months.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.620
Come to think of it, why do you suppose Amon showed up...

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:32.890
...out of the blue at the scene tonight?

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:36.230
Hey, you don't seriously thing that Amon was involved, do you?

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:39.630
No way, that's crazy!

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.500
Why would Mr. Amon attack Robin?

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:09.330
Why didn't you obey my order?!

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:17.260
If you had done what I'd ordered you to do, Touko wouldn't have been...

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:20.140
Touko wouldn't be...

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:44.690
Just how far back do I need to go?

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:47.550
Tell me.

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:59.540
It's all so vivid that it hurts.

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:09.430
The truth is, nothing can be shared,

00:23:09.110 --> 00:23:13.920
...so I never looked back.

00:23:15.190 --> 00:23:19.290
...all those promises...

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:25.690
...inside me eventually...

00:23:24.980 --> 00:23:31.490
...gave up on that light from some other time,

00:23:30.690 --> 00:23:40.270
...like the light of a morning you can't return to.
